# Shivering Isles. SE03 "A Better Mousetrap" and SE03A "Baiting the Trap". The player has come through the Gates of
# Madness (SE02 190) and stands in Sheogorath's palace (cell SENSCastleSheogorath).
#
# Path taken (SE03A branches in each of its three chambers): MANIA in all three. Chamber one Mania = the Giant Gnarl
# and the spore gas (SE03A.ChamberOne 2), chamber two Mania = the key fall (ChamberTwo 2, Syndelius searches the keys),
# chamber three Mania = Grommok's "ghost" (ChamberThree 2, GrommokInsane). Every Mania ending is scripted
# (SE03GrommokScript timers, SE03ManiaGnarl.StartMeUp 3 -> 8), so no fight depends on a kill; Dementia (swarm of mini
# Gnarls, hunger statues, zombies) is not drafted.
#
# SE03 "A Better Mousetrap": Sheogorath's chain "What do you want?" (INFO 00056049) -> "Changes?" (0005604A) ->
# "Greymarch?" (00056052, result startQuest SE03) -> "What now?" (00056095) -> "Why Xedilian?" (0006770C, result SE02
# 200 + SE03 8: Manual, SE03TuningFork, SE03QuestGateOpenTriggerREF enabled). SE03 stage 5 is only set by SE03's own
# stage 0 quickstart script, so stage 8 satisfies the Manual's OnEquip window (5 <= stage < 10). Haskill (moved to the
# palace by SEHaskillScript at the end of SE01) sets 10 with "Reactivated" (INFO 0008E94B). Entering Xedilian
# (SE03Script: within 800 of SE03EntryMarker) sets 15; each Focus Crystal is an item added by SE03ObeliskStaffNN
# (OnAdd player) when the player takes the staff off a Grummite Shaman (20/30/40, SE03FocusCrystalScript) and each
# Judgment Nexus (SE03JudgmentNexusScript01..03) takes one (25/35/45). SE03ResonatorScript: activating the Resonator
# with SE03TuningFork after 45 plays a 5 second timer, then SE03 200 (StartQuest SE03A, SE03A 5, Kiliban enabled).
#
# SE03A "Baiting the Trap": Kiliban force-greets inside control room one (5), "What should I do?" sets 10. The
# adventurers (SEGrommokRef, SELewinRef, SESyndelRef, enabled at 10) walk in when the player crosses a chamber's trigger
# box between its two buttons (12 / 18 / 47 when they stand in position), the player presses one button per chamber
# (15 / 20 / 50, set by SE03AScript and SE03GrommokScript), steps on each teleporter pad (SE03TeleportationPad01 doors)
# once the adventurers have left the chamber, and Kiliban's force-greet at 50 sets 55. In the reception chamber
# "You spoke of earnings?" sets 60. Leaving it wakes the three Knights of Order (SE03KnightsTrigger); their deaths set
# 70, and "What were those beings?" sets 200 (SetStage SE04shell 5, StopQuest SE03A, StartQuest SE03Fin): the last
# stage this file reaches.
# DRAFT 2026-11-17: not run yet.

# Sheogorath's greeting "A new arrival! ..." (INFO 0001B6A6, SE02 190 <= stage < 200) offers "What do you want?".
case se03_sheogorath
run
player.moveto SESheogorathRef
wait 120
approach SESheogorathRef
talk SESheogorathRef
ask "What do you want?"
ask "Changes?"
ask "Greymarch?"
ask "What now?"
ask "Why Xedilian?"
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 8
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 200
expect player.GetItemCount SE03TuningFork >= 1
bye if open
end

# Haskill stands in the palace (SE07AThadonMarker). His greeting at SE03 >= 8 "The Madgod has given you a task..."
# (INFO 0006D17C); the topic "Reactivated" (INFO 0008E94B, say once) sets 10 and he points to Xedilian.
case se03_haskill
run
player.moveto SEHaskillREF
wait 120
approach SEHaskillREF
talk SEHaskillREF
ask "Reactivated"
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 10
bye if open
end

# The door into Xedilian (REFR 0001317F, RuinsHallDoorSmallA01, Shivering Isles exterior near XedilianMapMarker) leads
# to XedilianExitREF in XPXedilian01; the player arrives about 200 from SE03EntryMarker: 15.
# The entry hall's gate (0003B9BB) is opened by the button 0003B9CA ("RuinsButtonDementia02", the entry side), the next
# gate (0003B9BC) by 0003B9FB; SE03QuestGateOpenTriggerREF (0007E0CC, enabled by SE03 8, 1186 south of the arrival point)
# opens SE03NothingToSeeHereREF when the player walks through it, so the hall walk goes to SE03KilibanMainHallMarker
# (0007F456) past the trigger. The rest of the long way to the crystals is a teleport.
case se03_enter_xedilian
run
player.moveto 0001317F
wait 120
run
player.moveto 0001317F
wait 30
activate 0001317F
until 600 GetStage SE03 >= 15
wait 60
run
player.moveto 0003B9CA
wait 30
activate 0003B9CA
wait 300
walk 0007F456
wait 60
run
player.moveto 0003B9FB
wait 30
activate 0003B9FB
wait 300
end

# Crystal one: the Grummite Shaman 00069707 (XPXedilian01, beside nexus one). The player kills it and takes its
# staff (RemoveAllItems stands in for looting; the staff's OnAdd gives SE03FocusCrystal, SE03FocusCrystalScript sets 20).
# Nexus one (00011EC6, SE03CrystalChamber01REF) takes the crystal: 25.
case se03_crystal1
run
player.moveto 00069707
wait 120
defend
until 3600 00069707.GetDead == 1
run
00069707.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 20
expect player.GetItemCount SE03FocusCrystal >= 1
run
player.moveto 00011EC6
wait 120
activate 00011EC6
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 25
end

# Crystal two: the Shaman 000696E0, nexus two 00011EE3 (SE03CrystalChamber02REF): 30, 35.
case se03_crystal2
run
player.moveto 000696E0
wait 120
defend
until 3600 000696E0.GetDead == 1
run
000696E0.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 30
expect player.GetItemCount SE03FocusCrystal >= 1
run
player.moveto 00011EE3
wait 120
activate 00011EE3
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 35
end

# Crystal three: the Shaman 0006972F in XPXedilian02 beside nexus three 00013CA2: 40, 45 ("the path to the Resonator
# is now clear").
case se03_crystal3
run
player.moveto 0006972F
wait 120
defend
until 3600 0006972F.GetDead == 1
run
0006972F.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 40
expect player.GetItemCount SE03FocusCrystal >= 1
run
player.moveto 00013CA2
wait 120
activate 00013CA2
until 300 GetStage SE03 >= 45
end

# The Resonator (SE03ResonatorREF, 000774F9, XPXedilian02) is guarded by Grummites (SE03LLGrummiteList02Resonator and
# a shaman without a crystal). The player lands 400 from it, fights, and activates it holding the Attenuator
# (SE03TuningFork): 5 seconds later SE03 200, which starts SE03A and sets its stage 5.
case se03_resonator
run
player.moveto 0007906F
wait 120
defend
approach 000774F9
expect player.GetItemCount SE03TuningFork >= 1
activate 000774F9
until 900 GetStage SE03 >= 200
until 300 GetStage SE03A >= 5
end

# The Resonator opens SE03DoneGateRef (000774F5); the teleporter pad SE03TeleportToRoom01REF (000774FD, 1100 north) takes
# the player to control room one (XPXedilian01), 140 from Kiliban (SEKilibanRef, enabled by SE03 200). SE03AScript then
# force-greets with SE03A >= 5 and Kiliban within 300: "Finally, Lord Sheogorath has sent someone to assist me!"
# (INFO 00018C6B) offers "Tell me about this place." (00018DF4) -> "Enough. How do I get out of here?" (00018DF5) ->
# "What should I do?" (00018DF6, sets 10). A short chain: "Interesting, tell me more." and "Why do I have to deal with
# this?" are other branches.
case se03a_kiliban
wait 300
run
player.moveto 000774FD
wait 30
activate 000774FD
hear 1800 SEKilibanRef Finally, Lord Sheogorath
ask "Tell me about this place."
ask "Enough. How do I get out of here?"
ask "What should I do?"
until 300 GetStage SE03A >= 10
bye if open
end

# Chamber one. The adventurers (enabled at 10) walk in once the player crosses SE03XedilianTriggerC1 (00072FEB, between
# the buttons at x -3936: Dementia 4752, Mania 5072); the player walks in from the observation area marker
# SE03Room01EnableREF (00050A8C) and through the box to a floor point past it. With all three in position (12) the
# Mania button (SE03ManiaButton01ActiveREF 00014347, "You must wait until the victims are in position." before) starts
# the Giant Gnarl; the adventurers flee it and OrcRoom1 sets 15.
case se03a_chamber1
walk 00050A8C
wait 60
walk -4050 4930 352
until 3600 GetStage SE03A >= 12
activate 00014347
until 600 SE03A.SwitchOne >= 1
until 9000 GetStage SE03A >= 15
end

# Chamber two. SE03AScript opens control room one's exit gate (SE03ControlRoom01ExitGateREF) when Grommok stands within
# 200 of Chamber2GrommokStarts; the pad ControlRoom01Door02REF (00011EF3, beyond it) leads to control room two. The
# player crosses SE03XedilianTriggerC2 (00073254, y 6044 between the buttons at x 2464 and 2800) from the north.
# Stage 18 = adventurers in position; SE03ManiaButton02ActiveREF (000142C5) drops the keys; Syndelius and Grommok
# search them (SE03GrommokScript RoomTwoTalkC chain) and OrcRoom2 sets 20.
case se03a_chamber2
run
player.moveto 0007E965
wait 60
until 3600 SEGrommokRef.GetDistance Chamber2GrommokStarts <= 200
run
player.moveto 00011EF3
wait 30
activate 00011EF3
wait 120
walk 2651 6500 -672
wait 30
walk 2651 5800 -672
until 3600 GetStage SE03A >= 18
activate 000142C5
until 600 SE03A.SwitchTwo >= 1
until 9000 GetStage SE03A >= 20
end

# Chamber three. The exit gate of control room two opens when Grommok is within 200 of Chamber3GrommokStarts; the pad
# ControlRoom02Door02REF (00011F0F) leads to control room three (XPXedilian02). The player crosses
# SE03XedilianTriggerC3 (000749DE, x -754, buttons at y 4080 and 4416) from the west; Grommok's package end sets 47.
# SE03ManiaButton03ActiveREF (00014360) sets GoGhosts: Grommok "dies" and speaks as SEGrommokGhostRef, then goes
# insane (SE03A.GrommokMan 3) and SE03GrommokScript sets 50.
case se03a_chamber3
run
player.moveto 0007E967
wait 60
until 3600 SEGrommokRef.GetDistance Chamber3GrommokStarts <= 200
run
player.moveto 00011F0F
wait 30
activate 00011F0F
wait 120
walk -1250 4250 -16
wait 30
walk -450 4250 -16
until 3600 GetStage SE03A >= 47
activate 00014360
until 600 SE03A.SwitchThree >= 1
until 9000 GetStage SE03A >= 50
end

# Kiliban force-greets (KiliMeetOne, SE03A >= 50, within 300): "You've made short work of the intruders. ..." (INFO
# 00019858, no topics, result SetStage SE03A 55).
case se03a_kiliban_done
hear 1800 SEKilibanRef made short work of the intruders
until 300 GetStage SE03A >= 55
bye if open
end

# 55 opens SE03ControlRoom03ExitGateREF (Kiliban activates it) and he walks to the reception chamber. The player steps on
# the last pad (SE03ControlRoom03Door02REF, 0001437C), arriving 420 from SE03KilibanFinalMarker; Kiliban comes within
# 600 and force-greets (Kiligreet2, GetStage SE03A == 55): "As is the tradition, you are to be awarded a focus crystal
# ..." (INFO 00019857) offers "You spoke of earnings?" (INFO 0007F3CF, a goodbye, sets 60: journal, recovery chest).
case se03a_reception
run
player.moveto 0007E968
wait 60
run
player.moveto 0001437C
wait 30
activate 0001437C
hear 1800 SEKilibanRef focus crystal as a token
ask "You spoke of earnings?"
until 300 GetStage SE03A >= 60
expect SE03A.Reward >= 1
bye if open
end

# Leaving the reception chamber: SE03WaitingRoomExitTrigger (00014346) opens the gate, SE03KnightsTrigger (000807B7, 300
# south of it) enables the three Knights of Order (SE03Knight01ListRef..03, 000807B3 / 000807B4 / 000807B5) at the
# entry door and blocks it with crystals (XedilianExitREF locked at 50). The player fights them near the gate;
# SE03AScript counts KnightCount to 3 and sets 70 (door unlocked), and Kiliban, still within 1000 of the player,
# force-greets (KiliMeetTwo): "That was quite a battle. I hope you are uninjured." (INFO 000807B2) offers "What were
# those beings?" (INFO 000807B9, a goodbye, sets 200).
case se03a_knights
walk -4312 10112 864
wait 120
walk -4252 9500 864
defend
until 9000 GetStage SE03A >= 70
hear 1800 SEKilibanRef That was quite a battle
ask "What were those beings?"
until 300 GetStage SE03A >= 200
bye if open
end
